  "note" : [
    {
      "text" : "With his condition he cannot take most of the medications for ADD - stimulants, BP medications. He really wanted to know whether to pursue this with a specialist. Reviewed some of the literature with him and web link below given. Modafanil could be used, but I cannot Rx it. I recommended continuing to adapt to this and not seeking further evaluation. He may want to look into the possibility of OSA, and I recommended he take vitamin D3 and consider melatonin in the evening."
    }
